    "description": "De-slop pass for any text. Scans for the statistical fingerprints of AI writing (negative parallelism / \"not X but Y\", em-dash density, rule-of-three, false ranges, puffery vocabulary, uniform cadence, hedged both-sidesing), rewrites by meaning, then re-scans until the text is clean and sits in the right register for its genre: academic article, tweet, reddit post, email, blog, docs, marketing. Use when the user says \"deslopify\", \"deslop\", \"de-slop this\", \"fuck slop\", \"f*ck slop\", \"remove the AI tells\", \"humanize this\", \"make this not sound like AI\", or invokes /deslopify (or the old /fuck-slop name). Also use before publishing any agent-drafted prose.",
